BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-81346\n\nSaturday 28 and Sunday 29 November\nBuses replace trains between Bathurst and Blacktown.\nT1 Western Line trains run to a changed timetable between Blacktown and Central\, platforms 1-14.\nIf travelling to Lithgow to connect with a NSW TrainLink Regional Coach\, call 132 232 before travelling to confirm departure times.
DTEND:20261129T125952Z
DTSTART:20261127T150000Z
SUMMARY:Buses replace trains between Bathurst and Blacktown
